# BOB Prompt Library - Agent Instructions

Mandatory: read `CLAUDE.md` and `DEVELOPER_GUIDELINES.md` (repo root) before any modification. If the task touches PocketBase schema/rules, Vercel deploy, or replicating this app's setup elsewhere, also load the `bob-webapp-stack` Claude skill (`.claude/skills/bob-webapp-stack/`).

Key rules:
- No mock-data fallback — the app requires a working `VITE_POCKETBASE_URL` and shows an explicit error/blocked state otherwise, never fake data.
- Premium UI/UX (haptics, dark mode, smooth transitions), violet/purple palette (not blue), WCAG AA contrast.
- Deploy target is Vercel (no Vite `base` path needed — this is not GitHub Pages).
- Single source of truth for config: `src/lib/pocketbase.js` and `src/lib/constants.js`.
- Category/type/tags are PocketBase `relation` fields (ids), not plain strings — convert at the boundary (see `references/crud-ui.md` in the skill), never pass raw ids into presentation components.
